# Focus loss: the window loses focus mid-trail, gets it back, typing resumes, and loses it again.

grid 16 80
style rainbow kitty
hz 60

at 0 pty "\e[9;1H$ "
at 700 key e
at 702 pty "e"
at 800 key c
at 802 pty "c"
at 900 key h
at 902 pty "h"
at 1000 key o
at 1002 pty "o"
at 1100 key space
at 1102 pty " "
at 1200 key t
at 1202 pty "t"
at 1300 key h
at 1302 pty "h"
at 1400 key e
at 1402 pty "e"
at 1500 key space
at 1502 pty " "
at 1600 key w
at 1602 pty "w"
at 1700 key i
at 1702 pty "i"
at 1800 key n
at 1802 pty "n"
at 1900 key d
at 1902 pty "d"
at 2000 key o
at 2002 pty "o"
at 2100 key w
at 2102 pty "w"
at 2200 env focus 0
at 3400 env focus 1
at 3600 key space
at 3602 pty " "
at 3700 key l
at 3702 pty "l"
at 3800 key o
at 3802 pty "o"
at 3900 key s
at 3902 pty "s"
at 4000 key e
at 4002 pty "e"
at 4100 key s
at 4102 pty "s"
at 4200 key space
at 4202 pty " "
at 4300 key f
at 4302 pty "f"
at 4400 key o
at 4402 pty "o"
at 4500 key c
at 4502 pty "c"
at 4600 key u
at 4602 pty "u"
at 4700 key s
at 4702 pty "s"
at 4800 key space
at 4802 pty " "
at 4900 key a
at 4902 pty "a"
at 5000 key n
at 5002 pty "n"
at 5100 key d
at 5102 pty "d"
at 5200 key space
at 5202 pty " "
at 5300 key g
at 5302 pty "g"
at 5400 key e
at 5402 pty "e"
at 5500 key t
at 5502 pty "t"
at 5600 key s
at 5602 pty "s"
at 5700 key space
at 5702 pty " "
at 5800 key i
at 5802 pty "i"
at 5900 key t
at 5902 pty "t"
at 6000 key space
at 6002 pty " "
at 6100 key b
at 6102 pty "b"
at 6200 key a
at 6202 pty "a"
at 6300 key c
at 6302 pty "c"
at 6400 key k
at 6402 pty "k"
at 6600 env focus 0
run 8000
